# Build context filter for images built from the repository root.
# The service's image is built from the Go module alone. This keeps out what it
# never reads and what is private: the history, local secrets and settings,
# documents, reference material, the SPA (Firebase Hosting serves it), the
# cloud's configuration, test data, tools, a local Go workspace, and whatever a
# build on this machine left.
.git
.github
.vscode
.sonarlint
.claude
.githooks
**/.env
**/.env.*
.devcontainer
reference
docs
draft
web
infra
**/testdata
tools
bin
dist
coverage.*
*.out
*.test
*.prof
.scannerwork
go.work
go.work.sum
*.md
**/node_modules
